# Cove rollout

Three rings. Same product names already in Settings and Admin.

| Ring | Name | Who | Invite button |
| 1 | Lab | Camron | (admin account) |
| 2 | Early access | Wife, parents | Early access invite |
| 3 | Family | Siblings and everyone else | Family invite |

Rings 2 and 3 share the live site today: https://halo-gules-three.vercel.app
The invite type is what differs. Do not invent a third URL unless Camron asks.

## Deploys

- Default: Lab only. `cd web && npm run deploy:lab` (preview URL, not production).
- Never `vercel --prod` / `deploy:early` unless Camron says **promote**, **early access**, **production**, or **emergency**.
- Family does not get a separate push yet. Promoting to Early access is the live site everyone else will use.

## QA before promote

Safari on iPhone, Chrome on desktop, Safari on desktop, plus `/preview` (Home, Chat, Invite, Login).
